## Why This Is Asked
This probes practical data masking, per-tenant policies, cross-region data flow, and reliable storage formats under real-world loads. It also tests observability, failure handling, and local testing strategies.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-region ingestion with Kinesis Data Streams
- Tenant-specific PIi masking rules (DynamoDB as policy store)
- Parquet storage and region/date partitioning in S3
- Deduplication by deviceId+ts (idempotent writes)
- DLQ routing for unmasked/failed records
- Observability via X-Ray and CloudWatch; LocalStack testing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo masking function sample
function maskRecord(record, policy) {
  const masked = { ...record };
  for (const field of policy.piList) {
    if (masked[field] !== undefined) {
      masked[field] = maskValue(masked[field]);
    }
  }
  return masked;
}
function maskValue(v){ return typeof v === 'string' ? v.replace(/./g,'*') : v; }
```

